# LF everywhere, on every OS: prompt goldens, the app guide's size guard and the shell scripts compare bytes, and a
# Windows checkout with core.autocrlf would otherwise turn them into CRLF.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.icns binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
# Archived evidence stays byte-exact (two evidence.csv files there were committed with CRLF).
docs/archive/** -text
